WS5 cross-owner patch: fork/tp5-compose/src/runtime.cpp (owner applies; not committed by WS5).
Slotizes channel ownership: 8 plan slots x 256 channel_state per window,
PLAN_RETIRED recycling, dual-window isolation, close-to-zero assertion,
and the fail-closed PLAN_UNION=1 / SLOT_CHANNELS=0 matrix.
Requires ggml/include/ggml-relay-plan.h from this branch.
Apply from the worktree root: git apply patches/ws5/runtime.cpp.patch

